    "detailed_description": "Gearhead Karting is the ultimate kart racing game for gamers who want more than just a casual racing experience. With a deep level of customization and tuning, realistic physics, and a variety of game modes, Gearhead Karting offers a racing experience like no other.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomize your kart with a wide variety of parts and accessories, including engines, tires, spoilers, and paint jobs. Fine-tune your ride to your heart's content, then hit the track to put your skills to the test. Choose from a variety of game modes, including Grand Prix, Time Attack, Drift, and Drag Racing, and challenge yourself to be the best.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut Gearhead Karting isn't just about racing - it's about building and maintaining your kart. With a wear and tear system, damage, and repair mechanics, you'll need to stay on top of your kart's condition to stay competitive. And with a variety of tracks, each with their own challenges and obstacles, you'll never run out of new racing experiences to try.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith stunning modern graphics and a dynamic soundtrack, Gearhead Karting is the ultimate kart racing game for PC gamers. And with deep customization, realistic physics, and a variety of game modes, it offers endless hours of entertainment. So rev up your engines and get ready to race - Gearhead Karting is waiting for you.",
    "about_the_game": "Gearhead Karting is the ultimate kart racing game for gamers who want more than just a casual racing experience. With a deep level of customization and tuning, realistic physics, and a variety of game modes, Gearhead Karting offers a racing experience like no other.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomize your kart with a wide variety of parts and accessories, including engines, tires, spoilers, and paint jobs. Fine-tune your ride to your heart's content, then hit the track to put your skills to the test. Choose from a variety of game modes, including Grand Prix, Time Attack, Drift, and Drag Racing, and challenge yourself to be the best.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut Gearhead Karting isn't just about racing - it's about building and maintaining your kart. With a wear and tear system, damage, and repair mechanics, you'll need to stay on top of your kart's condition to stay competitive. And with a variety of tracks, each with their own challenges and obstacles, you'll never run out of new racing experiences to try.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith stunning modern graphics and a dynamic soundtrack, Gearhead Karting is the ultimate kart racing game for PC gamers. And with deep customization, realistic physics, and a variety of game modes, it offers endless hours of entertainment. So rev up your engines and get ready to race - Gearhead Karting is waiting for you.",
    "short_description": "The ultimate kart racing game with deep customization, realistic physics, and a variety of game modes. Build, tune, and race your way to victory!",
